{"id":"vod_bf_5238","vodId":"5238","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"吹响悠风号","name_cn":"吹响悠风号","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-6/1e92ee3bbef80a1efac96c7da1b5964d.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生北宇治高中，黄前久美子（黑泽知叶 配音）刚刚踏入校园，对于未知的高中生活，久美子充满了憧憬。加藤叶月（朝井彩加 配音）是久美子的同级生，在叶月的极力劝说之下，耳根软的久美子在半推半就之下加入了学校的吹奏乐部。曾经，吹奏乐部有着十分辉煌的历史，然而，在换了顾问之后，吹奏乐部渐渐落寞，如今，音乐老师泷升（樱井孝宏 配音）作为新的顾问新鲜赴任，他对重振吹奏乐部，进军全国大会有着极大的信心。　　个性乐观开朗的川岛绿辉（丰田萌绘 配音）、理智冷静的高坂丽奈（安济知佳 配音）、大姐头田中明日香（寿美菜子 配音），在这些前辈们的陪伴和指导之下，久美子快乐的高中生活就此拉开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 23:28:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chuixiangyoufenghao/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chuixiangyoufenghao/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chuixiangyoufenghao/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chuixiangyoufenghao/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chuixiangyoufenghao/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chuixiangyoufenghao/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chuixiangyoufenghao/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chuixiangyoufenghao/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chuixiangyoufenghao/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chuixiangyoufenghao/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chuixiangyoufenghao/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chuixiangyoufenghao/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chuixiangyoufenghao/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"na